### Plot Code

::: {#e2a9381c .cell execution_count=13}
``` {.python .cell-code code-fold="true" code-summary="View Plot Code"}
import plotly.express as px

fig = px.scatter(
    residual_data,
    x="predicted_price",
    y="residual",
    title="Residual Diagnostic: What Is the Model Still Missing?"
)

fig.add_hline(y=0,line_dash="dash")

